<body>
    <h1>CareerPilot =E2=80=93 Wireframe Plan</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><time datetime=3D"2026-10-06" class=3D"date-past">06 Oct 2026</t=
ime> =C2=B7 Owner: Dan Glogoveanu =C2=B7 Status: <span class=3D"status-macr=
o aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-visual-refresh aui-lozenge-complete">IN REVIEW</s=
pan></p>
<p>The wireframe covers seven screens in one flow: SSO sign-in, onboarding,=
 job alerts and filters, job list, job focus with Apply, Prepare and Save, =
the application preparation page, and the application history with intervie=
w prep; desktop frames plus one mobile frame. It reflects the team's latest=
 decisions below; visual design follows in Figma with logo variant A.</p>
<h2 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-Decisionsupdate">Decisions upda=
te</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Topic</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Before</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Now</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Launch market</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Germany and Spain</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>One market for the MVP, to test the solution in a controlled setting. Ge=
rmany</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Job sources</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Official APIs and partnerships</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Public job lists of the Bundesagentur f=C3=BCr Arbeit for the MVP; Apply=
 opens the original job posting on the job site. Partner feeds come with em=
ployer login</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Roadmap after MVP</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Employer ads and talent search, then freemium</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>1. Employer login with its own onboarding (job ads, talent search, partn=
er job feeds, recruiter verification) to protect revenue =E2=86=92 2. Pay a=
s you apply: prepaid wallet and 10-credit packs for users who used their da=
ily credits =E2=86=92 3. Second market</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Credits</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>5 applications per day</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>10 credits per day; detailed matching, CV, cover letter and interview pr=
ep cost 1 credit each; the match score in the job list is free</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Preparation</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Documents generated from the job focus</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>A third button, "Prepare application", opens a preparation page: detaile=
d match, strategy, then CV, cover letter and interview prep</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Why it fits</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Top strength and top risk on every card</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>North star and the free evidence: a few words on why the job fits, posit=
ives only; gaps and risks are shown in Prepare. Pre-generated for the top 5=
 jobs; the rest generated when the card is opened or scrolled into view, th=
en cached</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Credit icon</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Open</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>The target (reticle "o" from logo A)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Logo</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Three directions</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Variant A, the reticle wordmark</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Credit top-up</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Wait for the daily reset</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Coming soon in the MVP: a prepaid wallet (top-up from =E2=82=AC10) buys =
10-credit packs at =E2=82=AC0.99; bought credits never expire. Goes live wi=
th pay as you apply after launch; free actions and the daily 10 stay unchan=
ged</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Interview prep</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Button on the preparation page</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>From the application history: confirming an application saves the job de=
scription there, and opening it later offers Prepare for interview (=E2=88=
=921)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Sign-in</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Google, LinkedIn, email</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Standard SSO card reused from a Figma Community component: Google, Micro=
soft, Apple, GitHub, LinkedIn</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Recruiter warning</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>In the MVP backlog</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Moves to employer login, which needs its own onboarding</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Frames</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Desktop, mobile later</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Desktop plus one mobile frame of the job focus</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><strong>Knock-on changes:</strong> the PRD and Jira follow these decisio=
ns. Pay as you apply keeps ranking neutrality: paying buys more application=
s, never a better position.</p>
<h2 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-Screenflow">Screen flow</h2><sp=
an class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluenc=
e-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-cente=
r" alt=3D"Wireframe screen flow from SSO sign-in to job focus, preparation =
page, application history and interview prep" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy=
" src=3D"466bf78dfc963295a8b14cec4584e33d2999b40a9198e63e4cd1f5392b81be59" =
data-image-src=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachment=
s/5177354/careerpilot-flow-v2.svg?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D179127=
7865421&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"610" data-width=
=3D"760" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"462=
0296" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attac=
hment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"careerpilot-flow-v2.svg" data-=
base-url=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-con=
tent-type=3D"image/svg+xml" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"5177354" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"6" data-media-id=3D"6fd34f1e-1af2-=
4b39-bce5-a2a40dc019c4" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"376"></span>
<p>Returning users skip onboarding and land on the job list. Apply opens th=
e original posting for free and, once confirmed, saves the job description =
to the application history, where interview prep waits; Prepare checks the =
daily credits before opening the preparation page.</p>
<h2 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-Globalframe">Global frame</h2>
<p>Every screen after sign-in shares one header and one footer, so they are=
 built once as components.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Element</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Content</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Notes</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Header, left</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Logo A (reticle wordmark)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Links to the job list</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Header, centre</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Navigation: Jobs =C2=B7 Saved =C2=B7 Applications =C2=B7 Profile</p></td=
>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Applications opens the application history (screen 7)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Header, right</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Credits pill "7 of 10 credits left today" =C2=B7 language switch DE / EN=
 =C2=B7 avatar menu</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Clicking the pill opens the top-up dialog (coming soon); at 0 it turns o=
range and shows the reset time and the top-up link</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Footer</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Privacy =C2=B7 Ranking policy ("No payment changes your ranking") =C2=B7=
 Imprint</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Ranking policy supports NFR1 and US22</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Frame size</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Desktop 1440 =C3=97 1024, 12-column grid</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Plus one mobile frame, 390 =C3=97 844, of the job focus</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-Credits">Credits</h3>
<p>Every user gets 10 credits per day, reset at 00:00 local time. A complet=
e application costs 4 credits: Prepare, CV and cover letter before applying=
, interview prep after. A user can prepare three jobs a day with CV and cov=
er letter.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Action</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Cost</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Match score and short "why it fits" in the job list and job focus</p></t=
d>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-visual-refresh aui-l=
ozenge-success">FREE</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Apply on job site, Save</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-visual-refresh aui-l=
ozenge-success">FREE</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Prepare application (detailed matching and strategy)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-visual-refresh aui-l=
ozenge-current">1 CREDIT</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Generate CV</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-visual-refresh aui-l=
ozenge-current">1 CREDIT</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Generate cover letter</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-visual-refresh aui-l=
ozenge-current">1 CREDIT</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Interview prep (from the application history)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-visual-refresh aui-l=
ozenge-current">1 CREDIT</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pay as you apply: pack of 10 credits from the prepaid wallet (coming soo=
n)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>=E2=82=AC0.99</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><strong>Credit badge:</strong> every paid button carries a small "=E2=88=
=921" badge with the target (reticle "o") as the credit icon, 16 px high. T=
ooltip: "Uses 1 credit =C2=B7 7 left today". At 0 credits the paid buttons =
are disabled and show "Resets at 00:00 =C2=B7 Buy 10 credits"; free actions=
 keep working. Every generation costs 1 credit, regenerations included.</p>
<p><strong>Pay as you apply (coming soon):</strong> clicking the credits pi=
ll opens a dialog with the prepaid wallet (top-up from =E2=82=AC10) and 10-=
credit packs at =E2=82=AC0.99, marked "Coming soon" with a disabled button,=
 so the demo shows the model without a payment flow. The 0-credit states li=
nk to the same dialog. After launch, bought credits never expire, are used =
after the daily ones and never change the ranking. The =E2=82=AC10 minimum =
means one card payment covers about ten packs instead of one fee per pack.<=
/p>
<p><strong>Cost target:</strong> at scale a complete application (4 credits=
) must cost under =E2=82=AC0.01 in AI and infrastructure, so under =E2=82=
=AC0.0025 per credit. A pack sells at =E2=82=AC0.099 per credit, and a user=
 spending all 10 free credits a day costs under =E2=82=AC0.025. The target =
makes the financials work from the MVP; if real costs come in higher, the p=
ack price goes up.</p>
<p><strong>Keeping the free "why" cheap:</strong> the score and the why com=
e from the same model call and are cached per job and profile, so each pair=
 is paid for once. Only the top 5 jobs of a digest are generated up front; =
the rest are generated the first time a card is opened or scrolled into vie=
w. A user who likes job 6 still sees its why for free, and Prepare stays on=
e click away.</p>
<h2 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-Screenspecs">Screen specs</h2>
<h3 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-1.SSOsign-in">1. SSO sign-in</h=
3>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> get in within one click and trust the product =
from the first screen. <strong>Stories:</strong> US8, US20, US22.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Region</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Elements</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Left half</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Logo A =C2=B7 headline "Know whether you fit the job, and why" =C2=B7 th=
ree trust points: Free for job seekers, No paid ranking, Your data stays in=
 the EU</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Right half, card</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Standard SSO card from a Figma Community component: "Continue with Googl=
e", "Continue with Microsoft", "Continue with Apple", divider "or", "Contin=
ue with GitHub", "Continue with LinkedIn" =C2=B7 terms and privacy line =C2=
=B7 language switch DE / EN</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Primary action:</strong> an SSO button; a new user goes to onboa=
rding, a returning user goes straight to the job list.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>States:</strong> sign-in cancelled ("Sign-in was cancelled. Try =
again."), provider error, loading.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-2.Onboarding(threesteps)">2. On=
boarding (three steps)</h3>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> a complete profile from the CV in under 5 minu=
tes. <strong>Stories:</strong> US8, US9, US15.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Step</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Elements</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>1 Upload CV</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Stepper 1 / 2 / 3 =C2=B7 drop zone "Drop your CV (PDF or DOCX)" =C2=B7 p=
arsing progress "Reading your CV=E2=80=A6"</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>2 Review profile</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pre-filled sections: experience, education, skills, languages with level=
s =C2=B7 low-confidence fields highlighted =C2=B7 completeness meter with t=
he 80% mark</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>3 Done</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>"Your profile is 86% complete" =C2=B7 CTA "Set up job alerts"</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Gate:</strong> below 80%, the CTA reads "Add 2 missing fields to=
 unlock matching" and links each missing field.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>States:</strong> CV cannot be read (manual form showing which se=
ctions failed), second CV in another language (merge prompt, US15, Should).=
</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-3.Jobalertsandfilters">3. Job a=
lerts and filters</h3>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> set preferences once; every suggestion fits. <=
strong>Stories:</strong> US14, US1.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Region</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Elements</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Form</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Roles or domains (chips) =C2=B7 seniority =C2=B7 location with distance =
slider (km) =C2=B7 remote toggle =C2=B7 working languages =C2=B7 minimum ma=
tch slider (default 75%)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Alert settings</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Frequency daily or weekly =C2=B7 day and time =C2=B7 channel email or in=
-app</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Side panel</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Live preview "About 24 jobs match this week"</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Primary action:</strong> "Save and show my jobs".</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>States:</strong> zero matches ("No jobs match. Try a larger dist=
ance.").</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-4.Joblist">4. Job list</h3>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> review the digest in one sitting and decide wh=
at to open. <strong>Stories:</strong> US1, US2, US6, US16.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Region</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Elements</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Top bar</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>"12 new matches =C2=B7 updated Mon 08:00" =C2=B7 sort: best match, newes=
t =C2=B7 "Edit alerts"</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Left rail</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Quick filters: remote, distance, language, minimum match</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Job card</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Title =C2=B7 company =C2=B7 location or remote =C2=B7 posted date =C2=B7=
 source chip =C2=B7 language chip (e.g. German C1) =C2=B7 match badge 82% w=
ith confidence (free) =C2=B7 "Why it fits" in a few words, positives only (=
top 5 pre-generated, others on first view) =C2=B7 Save icon</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Bottom</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Collapsed "Near misses (4)" section (Could)</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Primary action:</strong> open a card into job focus. <strong>Sec=
ondary:</strong> Save from the card.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>States:</strong> loading skeleton, empty digest, profile below t=
he gate (scores hidden, banner to complete the profile).</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-5.Jobfocus">5. Job focus</h3>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> decide in seconds: apply directly, prepare fir=
st, or save for later. <strong>Stories:</strong> US2, US6, US10, US17, US21=
.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Region</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Elements</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Header</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Title =C2=B7 company =C2=B7 location =C2=B7 posted date =C2=B7 source =
=C2=B7 language requirement chip</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Score block (free)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Match 82% =C2=B7 confidence label =C2=B7 "How this score is calculated" =
(side drawer: each criterion, weight and contribution)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Why it fits (free)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>A few words on the strongest reasons the job fits, positives only; "See =
gaps, risks and the full match in Prepare"</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Job ad</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Original ad text in its own language</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Sticky action bar</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Primary "Prepare application" with =E2=88=921 badge (accent) =C2=B7 seco=
ndary "Apply on job site" =C2=B7 tertiary "Save"</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Prepare application (=E2=88=921):</strong> deducts 1 credit and =
opens the preparation page. Reopening a job already prepared is free.</p></=
li>
<li>
<p><strong>Apply on job site (free):</strong> opens the original job postin=
g in a new tab. On return: "Did you apply?" Yes logs the application and sa=
ves the job description to the application history.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Save (free):</strong> toggles to "Saved"; the job appears under =
Saved.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Why Prepare is the primary button:</strong> it is where CareerPi=
lot adds value over the job board; Apply stays one click away.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>States:</strong> no credits left (Prepare disabled, "Resets at 0=
0:00 =C2=B7 Buy 10 credits"; Apply and Save still work), job expired at the=
 source (Apply disabled, "This job is no longer available").</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Mobile frame:</strong> the job focus also gets one 390 =C3=97 84=
4 frame: score, why it fits and the job ad stacked, with Prepare, Apply and=
 Save in a bar fixed at the bottom.</p>
<h3 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-6.Applicationpreparation">6. Ap=
plication preparation</h3>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> understand the fit in depth, agree a strategy,=
 then generate the documents. <strong>Stories:</strong> US3, US5, US6, US10=
.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Region</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Elements</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Header</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Back to job =C2=B7 job title and company =C2=B7 credits pill =C2=B7 "App=
ly on job site"</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Detailed match</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Four groups: strengths, gaps, transferables, risks; each point links to =
the CV and ad passage; language requirement vs. profile level</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Strategy</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>AI proposal: three points to emphasise =C2=B7 how to address each gap =
=C2=B7 tone (formal or neutral) =C2=B7 document language (defaults to the a=
d's) =C2=B7 every item editable =C2=B7 "Confirm strategy"</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Documents</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>"Generate CV" =E2=88=921 =C2=B7 "Generate cover letter" =E2=88=921, enab=
led once the strategy is confirmed =C2=B7 after generation: preview with ch=
anges highlighted, accept, reject or edit each change, export PDF or DOCX</=
p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Steps:</strong> detailed match is shown on arrival (credit alrea=
dy used) =E2=86=92 user confirms or edits the strategy =E2=86=92 generates =
CV and/or cover letter =E2=86=92 Apply on job site. Interview prep comes la=
ter, from the application history.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>States:</strong> generating (progress per document), statement n=
ot supported by the profile (flagged, export blocked until resolved), out o=
f credits mid-way (paid buttons disabled, strategy still editable, "Buy 10 =
credits" offered), regenerate (confirm dialog: "This uses 1 more credit").<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-7.Applicationhistory">7. Applic=
ation history</h3>
<p><strong>Purpose:</strong> one place for every application, and the entry=
 point to interview prep. <strong>Stories:</strong> US4, US11, US18.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Region</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Elements</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>List</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>One row per application: title, company, applied date, source, status ch=
ip (Applied, Interview, Offer, Rejected), document version =C2=B7 filter by=
 status</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Detail</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>The job description saved when the user confirmed the application, reada=
ble even after the posting expires =C2=B7 documents used =C2=B7 status chan=
ge in two clicks</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Interview</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>"Prepare for interview" =E2=88=921: questions based on the saved job des=
cription and the gaps</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Primary action:</strong> open an application, read the saved job=
 description, then Prepare for interview.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Why interview prep lives here:</strong> it only matters once the=
 user has applied; offering it when a job is first opened would spend a cre=
dit too early.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>States:</strong> empty ("Applications you confirm appear here"),=
 posting expired at the source (saved description still shown), reminder af=
ter 10 days without a status change (US11), no credits left (Prepare for in=
terview disabled, "Resets at 00:00 =C2=B7 Buy 10 credits").</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-Wireframeconventions">Wireframe=
 conventions</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Fidelity:</strong> greyscale boxes and real copy, no lorem ipsum=
; the orange accent marks only the primary action.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Language:</strong> UI text in English for the prototype; German =
version after the visual design.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Grid:</strong> 8-point spacing, 12-column desktop grid, type sca=
le 32 / 24 / 18 / 16 / 14.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Reusable components:</strong> SSO card (Figma Community), header=
, footer, primary and secondary button, credit badge, filter chip, job card=
, match badge, evidence group, stepper, confirm dialog.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Annotations:</strong> each frame names the user stories it cover=
s, so the demo maps to Jira.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Prototype links:</strong> SSO =E2=86=92 onboarding =E2=86=92 ale=
rts =E2=86=92 job list =E2=86=92 job focus =E2=86=92 preparation page =E2=
=86=92 generate CV, plus Apply =E2=86=92 application history =E2=86=92 Prep=
are for interview, and Save, to click through live in the 7-minute demo.</p=
></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Not in this wireframe:</strong> the interview prep content itsel=
f (only its entry button), employer login with its own onboarding, recruite=
r warnings, the payment step behind buying extra credits. They stay in the =
backlog or later phases.</p>
<h2 id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=80=93WireframePlan-QuestionsresolvedbeforeFigma">Q=
uestions resolved before Figma</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Sign-in:</strong> standard SSO, reusing a Figma Community compon=
ent (Google, Microsoft, Apple, GitHub, LinkedIn).</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Job lists:</strong> Bundesagentur f=C3=BCr Arbeit lists are enou=
gh for the MVP.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Frames:</strong> desktop plus one mobile frame (the job focus).<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Bought credits:</strong> never expire.</p></li>
</ul>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
